  "body": "The [attributes overview](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#attributes-3) seems to contain two errors:\r\n\r\n1. [`hidden`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-hidden-attribute) is marked as Boolean even though it is now enumerated.\r\n2. [`truespeed`](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#attr-marquee-truespeed) seems to be missing even though it’s still part of the spec.\r\n\r\n1 ) seems to be a mistake, but I’m unclear about 2) (perhaps this kind of reduced visibility is intentional, given that `truespeed` is used with `marquee`?).\r\n\r\nMay be able to file a PR if someone can confirm or clarify.",
